& [VerifiedCapabilitySet] is what the experiment actually proves
  + [capability] is an unmodified llama-server can expose an OpenAI-compatible tool interface to the local model
  + [capability] is the model emitted exactly one cantor_reflect call with exact subject, purpose, and requested expression_style for every final trial
  + [capability] is the host can validate the call before returning a deterministic semantic expression
  + [capability] is a subsequent inference request can receive the prior assistant tool call and tool result through ordinary chat history
  + [capability] is the model can import verbose, condensed, and directive expressions into one normalized semantic contract
  + [capability] is a strict host validator can reject schema and semantic drift without treating plausible wording as success
  + [capability] is provider-private reasoning fields can be excluded from durable evidence
  = limit: this is checkpointed multi-request inference, not a mid-token external intervention
  = limit: the deterministic fixture is not yet a signed SOP database or semantic router
  = limit: one ambiguity fixture and one model do not establish general reliability, scale, or cross-model portability

& [FinalExpressionSet] is the accepted transportable semantic state
  + [verbose] is For the stated purpose, interpret bank as financial_institution, exclude river_bank, and proceed to compare_account_options
  + [condensed] is SUBJECT bank | PURPOSE decide where to deposit a paycheck | SELECT financial_institution | EXCLUDE river_bank | NEXT compare_account_options
  + [directive] is OBSERVE subject=bank; NAME selected_identity=financial_institution; EXCLUDE excluded_identity=river_bank; BOUND purpose; EMIT next_action=compare_account_options
  = invariant: every form names the semantic role of each identity rather than relying on punctuation or word order alone

& [ObservedFaultProgression] is retained negative evidence
  + [run_01] is exact tool calls followed by unnormalized tool-result echo
  + [run_02] is an explicit second checkpoint without a repeated tool declaration still followed by echo
  + [run_03] is repeated tool declaration without tool_choice none still followed by echo or empty final content
  + [run_04] is tool_choice none with a schema constraint but without schema field semantics articulated to the model still produced the wrong six fields
  + [run_05] is verbose and directive passed while condensed bank@financial_institution was interpreted as the whole selected identity
  + [run_06] is verbose and revised condensed passed while NAME bank AS financial_institution was nondeterministically interpreted as bank being the selected identity
  + [correction] is explicitly declare the second-checkpoint field roles and make every compact and directive identity boundary syntactically named
  = finding: concise organization improved reliability only after semantic roles became explicit

